     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><div><div>Hi Viktor,<br><br></div>maybe my last post in <a href=\"https://github.com/paul-buerkner/brms/issues/303\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/paul-buerkner/brms/issues/303&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792451377438000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2z2jIFfVrOG4IMERhTM4ws\">https://github.com/paul-buerkner/brms/issues/303</a> can help you.<br><br></div>Best<br></div>Paul\r\n\r\n<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
